{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2024-03", "window": 2, "start_date": 1709856000, "end_date": 1710547199, "month_true_total": 26, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:23:43 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "160621954", "author": {"steamid": "76561199635311002", "personaname": "SirAbacus.o1", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199635311002/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 3732, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 426, "last_played": 1765742186, "avatar": "64c95a2420adb9df2f9d447b22f580a983cd2cb2"}, "language": "english", "review": "It did get a remaster with more content and better visuals, but the original has that indie game charm. Occasional bugs, some exploitable oversights, and overall a good time. One bad thing is that turning on controller support turns off keyboard controls, but that's only a small issue. I have had hours of fun in the console versions, and I'm ready for more on PC. \n\nAs to whether the remaster is better or not, I'd say they both have merits and disadvantages, and it's hard for me to choose one over the other. So I bought both.\n\nAbsolutely have gotten more than $10 of fun out of this game.", "timestamp_created": 1710545050, "timestamp_updated": 1710545050, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "160582992", "author": {"steamid": "76561198957474376", "personaname": "Manguwu", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/mangoman9895/", "num_games_owned": 173, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 382, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 382, "last_played": 1694